2.  These writ petitions have been filed by individual petitioners raising challenge to the Bye-laws dated 10.12.2021 notified (on 01.02.2022) by the Municipal Corporation, Bareilly levying Advertisement Fees on hoardings etc. Also, challenge has been raised to individual demand orders issued to the petitioners dated 16.08.2021 in Writ Petition 28984 of 2022 and dated 16.08.2021 in Writ-C No.14655 of 2022. Further, challenge has been raised to the document dated 16.08.2021,
whereby the objections raised by the petitioners to the proposed Bye-laws, have been rejected. Last,
challenge has been laid to subsequent tender notices. 
3. For ready reference, the facts narrated in Writ-C No.28948 of 2022, S.S. Graphics Vs. State of U.P. and others are being noted. There exists a Municipal Corporation at Bareilly. It is governed by the provisions of the U.P. Municipal Corporations Act, 1959 (hereinafter referred to as the Act). 
